---
import BaseLayoutV2 from '../layouts/BaseLayoutV2.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import SectionNav from '../components/SectionNav.astro';
---

<BaseLayoutV2
  title="Research | GreenSquare AI"
  description="The evidence, limits and study record behind our approach to professional judgement."
  current="research"
>
  <div>
    <section class="research-hero v-hero v-hero--editorial">
      <div class="v-container">
        <h1>Test the method.<br />Publish the boundary.</h1>
        <p class="v-lead">We study whether structured decision support improves professional judgement, and state plainly what the evidence cannot yet establish.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SectionNav
      items={[
        { id: 'finding', label: 'Finding' },
        { id: 'boundary', label: 'Boundary' },
        { id: 'record', label: 'Study record' },
        { id: 'next', label: 'Next work' },
      ]}
    />

    <section class="v-section" id="finding">
      <div class="v-container finding-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>The structured process is where the tested change showed up.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="finding-copy">
          <p>In our initial preregistered benchmark, the loaded condition matched or exceeded an informed baseline on the measured judgement outcomes.</p>
          <p>That is evidence for a structured method under the tested conditions. It is not proof of universal performance.</p>
          <a class="v-link" href={withBase('/benchmark/')}>Read the full benchmark</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section" id="boundary">
      <div class="v-container evidence-boundary">
        <h2>Under the tested conditions, the structured method improved how the decision was worked.</h2>
        <div class="boundary-grid">
          <p><strong>Supported:</strong> the loaded condition matched or exceeded the informed baseline on the measured judgement outcomes.</p>
          <p><strong>Not established:</strong> performance across every decision type, organisation, user population or model environment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section" id="record">
      <div class="v-container record-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>Inspect the claim, method and frozen source material.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="record-links">
          <a href={withBase('/benchmark/')}><span>Results</span><strong>Benchmark record</strong></a>
          <a href={withBase('/methodology/')}><span>Design</span><strong>Methodology</strong></a>
          <a href="https://github.com/greensquare-ai/website/tree/main/evidence/preregistration"><span>Source</span><strong>Frozen preregistration</strong></a>
        </div>
        <p class="historical-note"><strong>Historical naming note.</strong> The published study used earlier internal product names and predates Frame. It is evidence about the tested method and condition, not a test of the current Frame Free plan or the future Frame Pro plan.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="v-section" id="next">
      <div class="v-container next-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>Future work needs to widen the test: more decision domains, more users, sharper measurement of the outcome.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Future studies should test different decision domains, model environments and user populations, with clearer measurement of downstream action and decision quality.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayoutV2>

<style>
  .research-hero h1 { max-width:12ch; }
  .research-hero .v-lead { max-width:48rem; }
  .finding-grid, .record-grid, .next-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(18rem,.75fr); gap:clamp(3rem,8vw,8rem); align-items:start; }
  .finding-copy p { font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.3rem); }
  .finding-copy .v-link { display:inline-block; margin-top:1rem; }
  .evidence-boundary { max-width:67rem; }
  .boundary-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:2rem; border-top:1px solid var(--v-line); margin-top:3rem; padding-top:1.5rem; }
  .boundary-grid p { margin:0; }
  .record-links a { display:grid; grid-template-columns:5rem 1fr; gap:1rem; padding:1.4rem 0; color:var(--v-ink); text-decoration:none; border-top:1px solid var(--v-line); }
  .record-links span { color:var(--v-ink-soft); font:600 var(--vs-label)/1.4 var(--vf-body); }
    .historical-note { grid-column:1/-1; max-width:60rem; margin-top:4rem; padding-top:1.5rem; border-top:1px solid var(--v-line); color:var(--v-ink-soft); font-size:.88rem; }
  .next-grid > p { color:var(--v-ink-soft); font-size:1.1rem; }
  @media (max-width:760px) {
    .finding-grid, .record-grid, .next-grid, .boundary-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .record-links a { grid-template-columns:4.5rem 1fr; }
  }
</style>
